      "statement": "The old bank put every player card at y 1029–1045; the saved plan is an arc. No old deal lands within 14 px of the plan; P7 is 130–143 px off."
    },
    {
      "id": "covered-start-never-existed",
      "evidence": "runs/20261110-pamela-draw-pilot-prep/PILOTBRIEF.md",
      "statement": "The covered start (card fully inside the shoe) was ordered in the old lab and listed as missing. READY2 was an image-generated attempt and is not user accepted."
    },
    {
      "id": "kling4-middle-frames",
      "evidence": "docs.dev.runwayml.com/openapi.json read 2026-11-10",
      "statement": "kling_4 accepts first, up to eight middle and last images on /v1/image_to_video. The earlier contract dismissed it only because audio cannot be disabled. Not tested here."
    }
  ],
